---
title: MediSense AI - Patient Chat with RAG
---
flowchart TD
    A([Patient sends message]) --> B[chat.py POST /chat]
    B --> C[fetch_iot_context 30d]
    C --> D[Detect language Darija/AR/FR]
    D --> E[Normalize to clinical French - Mistral 7B]
    E --> F[Parallel retrieval Qdrant RRF + BM25 + MCP ANSM/ICD-11]
    F --> G[Medical entity extraction + ICD-10 boost]
    G --> H{safety.py pre_check}
    H -- block low confidence --> Z1[Return safe disclaimer only]
    H -- urgent or IoT critical --> ESC[Triage URGENT -> CRM SAMU 141 + FCM]
    H -- ok --> I[llm.py generate stream]
    I --> J[safety.py post_check dosage + disclaimer]
    J --> K[Persist conversation + Redis cache 24h]
    K --> Z([Stream response to patient])
    ESC --> Z
    Z1 --> Z
